Error: Jet.UseAfterMove: `owned` was consumed by `consume`, so it can't be used here
  --> Tests/UI/E0121_task_capture_used_after_its_move_in_the_body.jet:12:19
    |
 12 |             owned.n
    |                   ^
  --> Tests/UI/E0121_task_capture_used_after_its_move_in_the_body.jet:11:29
    |
 11 |             ^first: consume(owned)
    |                             ^^^^^ `owned` moved to `consume` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `owned` after the move, or give `consume` a copy with `owned.copy()` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UseAfterMove
